    "approval": "The successful browser invocation uses trusted UI clicks for Get platform quote, Confirm maximum and Approve. The maximum textbox is asserted and filled with zero. The quote and decision APIs are triggered by the visible controls.",
    "fixture": "Dedicated scripted free text planner returns one generate_media tool call, then completion. Existing zero-price fixture-openai accepts the sealed input.",
    "visibility": "The dedicated planner model is published to W7 Studio. Other W7 Studio users may see it.",
    "records": "Original Platform, Studio and Gateway rows are read in read-only transactions. Original bytes are downloaded through the authenticated Studio route with purpose=download&variant=original."
